{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 55, :comments ["<b>And her brother and her mother said.</b> And where was Bethuel? He wanted to delay, and an angel came and killed him." "<b>Days.</b> A year, as in ״יָמִים תִּהְיֶה גְּאֻלָּתוֹ״ (Leviticus 25) — for thus they give a virgin twelve months' time to prepare herself with adornments (Ketubot 57)." "<b>Or ten.</b> Ten months; and if you say literal days — it is not the way of those who make a request to ask for a small amount, and then 'if you do not wish, give us more than this.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:00:19.971817340Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}